e": "Merge pull request #129 from donkevlar/dev_patch\n\nRefactor: Convert database operations to async with SQLite/MariaDB support", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:58:24Z", "repo": "Bookshelf-Traveller", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b157e59e90a283d560f949c34633acdd99c3ad44", "message": "Refactor: Convert database operations to async with SQLite/MariaDB support\n\nConverted wishlist.py and subscription_task.py to use async database operations\nAdded abstract database interfaces with SQLite and MariaDB implementations\nUpdated main.py to initialize async databases in bot's event loop on startup\nAdded database connection pooling and proper cleanup on shutdown\nUpdated requirements.txt with aiosqlite, aiomysql, and pytz dependencies\nDatabase type configurable via DB_TYPE environment variable (defaults to SQLite)\nAll database functions now use await for non-blocking operations\nAdded startup synchronization to ensure database initialization before extension usage\nFixed event loop compatibility issues for MariaDB connection pools\nAdded automatic detection for sync/async multi_user module compatibility\n\nBreaking Changes:\n\nRequires aiosqlite>=0.17.0 and aiomysql>=0.2.0\nDatabase initialization occurs in on_startup event within bot's event loop\n\nConfiguration:\n\nSQLite (default): DB_TYPE=sqlite\nMariaDB: Set DB_TYPE=mariadb plus connection details (DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD, DB_NAME)", "created_at": "2025-12-04T20:57:03Z", "repo": "Bookshelf-Traveller", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c86acb82d2ec0204eff3f721504dbceab5ddc40e", "message": "Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/master'", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:58:58Z", "repo": "Bookshelf-Traveller", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c380aff5de22f7fed7014d92885a1adec7a3af72", "message": "Bumbed discord-py-interactions to 5.15", "created_at": "2025-11-28T23:58: